    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your Thorngrip shuffler convulses, readying its barbs to snag prey. Until the start of your next turn, your Strikes that damage a creature in the shuffler's reach also hook that creature. A creature remains hooked until the start of your next turn. If a hooked creature within the shuffler's reach takes an action with the move trait other than Step, that creature takes @Damage[1d6[piercing]] damage. If your Thorngrip shuffler is nimble or savage, the damage increases to @Damage[2d6[piercing]]. A creature takes this damage only once per round.</p><p></p>",
